.DS_Store

# Apple Ads session cookie for scripts/popularity.mjs, if you keep it in a file
# rather than typing it. It is a live credential: committing it hands anyone
# reading the repo your Apple Ads session.
.env
.asa-cookie

# App Store Connect analytics used to stay local, on the grounds that daily
# impressions, downloads and deletions by country are a business ledger. That
# is still what they are; publishing them is now a deliberate choice rather
# than an oversight, taken so the ingest can run in CI at all -- a runner can
# only aggregate what the repo carries, and the ingest is stateful, so
# index.json has to persist between runs or overlapping rolling windows get
# counted twice.
#
# What is NOT public, and must not become so: the App Store Connect signing
# key. It reaches CI as ASC_KEY_ID / ASC_ISSUER_ID / ASC_PRIVATE_KEY, set as
# repository secrets, and the key used is the read-only reporting key rather
# than the Admin one.
